# upstream-4018-drawing-engine-cleanup
#
# Verbatim backport of upstream OpenLoco 6072709d, "Software drawing engine
# proper cleanup (#4018)", merged 2026-09-14 - four days after our pinned
# af445f8. The drawing engine's destructor frees textures, surfaces, palette
# and the renderer in reverse order of creation; it fixes the destructor
# nulling _screenTexture where it meant _scaledScreenTexture; and
# exitCleanly() calls the new Gfx::disposeDrawingEngine(), so the engine is
# gone before exit() rather than in a static destructor afterwards.
#
# Applies unchanged - generated as `git show 6072709d` on top of patches 01-17.
# Drop this patch when the pin moves past 6072709d.
#
# Against OpenLoco af445f8dc6632c6341fc7b26c3246685406e6815, applied with -p1 by scripts/bootstrap.sh.
# Saved 2026-09-20.

